1
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,080
Zhao.

2
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,480
Zhao, the tanks are here.

3
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,280
Thanks, San.

4
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:34,840
Thanks.

5
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,600
Let me do it.

6
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,600
No, leave it alone.

7
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,460
You're not wearing a coat. Hurry.

8
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,640
Xiaolong.

9
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:42,039
What are you tinkering with?

10
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,160
What's the filling?

11
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,120
Pickled cabbage.

12
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,920
Put it inside?

13
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,520
No need. Just wait for your brother

14
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,720
to come back and do it.

15
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,039
Hurry home and eat.

16
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,320
Okay.

17
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,920
Thanks, San.

18
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,520
I'm leaving, Sister-in-law.

19
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:55,240
The client is waiting for the delivery.

20
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,800
Get up. Get up.

21
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,680
Look at what you've done.

22
00:01:59,759 --> 00:02:00,360
Zhao.

23
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,720
It's the New Year.

24
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,580
That's enough.

25
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,250
Take it easy.

26
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,160
Do you know why

27
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:09,400
the three of us have to live in the factory now?

28
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,039
You didn't go home even when the power went out.

29
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:13,360
Wasn't it to keep an eye on this batch of materials?

30
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,720
How am I supposed to explain this to the client?

31
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,920
All right, all right.

32
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,560
Why are you scolding the kid?

33
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,040
Come back early.

34
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:12,480
Attention, passengers.

35
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,680
We are arriving at Xinchun soon.

36
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,960
We are entering the mountains ahead.

37
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,079
Are you getting off at Xinchun Station?

38
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:17,640
Yes.

39
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,680
Alright, passengers.

40
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,800
Please pack your luggage.

41
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:24,260
We are arriving at Xinchun Station shortly.

42
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,579
Excuse me. Excuse me, bro.

43
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,520
Take it out.

44
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,920
What are you doing? Move.

45
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,760
Take it out.

46
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,040
What are you talking about?

47
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,880
I don't have anything.

48
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:40,480
Hurry up.

49
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,240
Here, here, here.

50
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,570
Right here, right here.

51
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,100
Here you go.

52
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:55,920
Thank you.

53
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,930
From out of town?

54
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:00,760
Yes.

55
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,890
In the timber business?

56
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,760
Just here to look at some timber.

57
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,000
Xinchun has good timber.

58
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,920
But it's a tricky place.

59
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,580
Be careful.

60
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,960
How should I address you?

61
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,280
We are arriving at Xinchun Station.

62
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,600
Please take your luggage and prepare to disembark.

63
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,600
Xinchun Station.

64
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,600
Boss, need a car?

65
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,640
To the forest farm.

66
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:36,000
Thank you.

67
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,320
Boss, looking for a hotel or buying timber?

68
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,380
To the forest farm.

69
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,120
Boss, looking for a hotel

70
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,560
or buying timber?

71
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,280
Boss, need a car?

72
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,040
Everything is cheap.

73
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,720
No, thanks.

74
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,880
Boss, looking for a hotel

75
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:44,760
or buying timber?

76
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,520
Everything is cheap,

77
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:45,800
boss.

78
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,400
No, thanks.

79
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:46,760
Looking for a hotel?

80
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,360
Or buying timber?

81
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,560
Everything is cheap.

82
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,940
No more cars. Let's go.

83
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,530
Let's go.

84
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,040
Are you

85
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,600
Boss Wang?

86
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,040
Hello.

87
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:59,360
I'm Boss Lin's dri-

88
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,340
secretary.

89
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,460
Just call me Dajun.

90
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,800
Let me help you with your luggage.

91
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,200
Okay.

92
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,120
Come.

93
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:05,760
Illegal cab.

94
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,800
This one.

95
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,280
Mr. Wang, is this your first time in Xinchun?

96
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:32,720
Yes.

97
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,200
Mr. Lin

98
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,280
specifically instructed me

99
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,920
to make sure you are picked up safely

100
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,850
without a hitch.

101
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,320
Thank Mr. Lin for me.

102
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,040
He's so busy but still thought of me.

103
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,560
Of course.

104
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,680
By the way,

105
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,210
Mr. Wang,

106
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,720
this afternoon, the Forestry Bureau

107
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,800
is organizing a visit for Xinchun's

108
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,159
local timber bosses

109
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:50,240
to Mr. Lin's factory to learn about production.

110
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,880
Mr. Lin asked me to take you there

111
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,640
so you can learn about

112
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,320
the market and policies.

113
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:58,159
I get to attend such an event right after arriving in Xinchun.

114
00:05:58,159 --> 00:06:00,360
I really should thank Mr. Lin properly.

115
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,160
I can tell you're from a big city, Mr. Wang.

116
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,760
You're so good with words.

117
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,480
By the way,

118
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,130
about the thing you wanted,

119
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,960
Mr. Lin is looking for it.

120
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,080
Basically,

121
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:09,880
am I

122
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,640
blind?

123
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,440
Teng Xiaohu,

124
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,200
did you do that on purpose?

125
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:26,260
Do you know who Mr. Lin's VIP guest is?

126
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,680
What are you looking at?

127
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,360
What if I am looking at you?

128
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,880
What do you mean, 'what if'?

129
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:30,440
What do you want?

130
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,280
What do you want?

131
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,440
What do you want to do?

132
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,320
Tell me what you want to do.

133
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:33,960
What do you want?

134
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:34,640
What?

135
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,440
What's wrong?

136
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,200
Isn't this Mr. Wang?

137
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,320
Look at this.

138
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,520
It's a misunderstanding.

139
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:43,960
Look,

140
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,520
I'm sorry.

141
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,720
How do you know me?

142
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,920
A big boss came from Jiangcheng.

143
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,940
The whole Xinchun knows about it.

144
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,450
Mr. Wang.

145
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:56,360
I see you are going to Director Lin's place.

146
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:57,960
How about this.

147
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:58,690
Get in my car.

148
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,930
I'll take you there.

149
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,440
No, thanks.

150
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,210
Let's go.

151
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,920
What are you doing?

152
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,280
Mr. Wang, you go up first.

153
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:06,600
What are you doing?

154
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,730
Do you want to fight?

155
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,320
I've given you enough face.

156
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:10,880
You guys sort this out.

157
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,810
I'll take a taxi.

158
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,400
Mr. Wang.

159
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,040
My car is safe.

160
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,330
Do you want to get in?

161
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,280
Okay.

162
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,120
Li Xuefei.

163
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,200
Why are you everywhere?

164
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,530
What are you doing here?

165
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,560
Do you own the road?

166
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,440
I can go wherever I want.

167
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,370
Get out of my way.

168
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,100
I'm sick of looking at you.

169
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,600
What?

170
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,780
Dare to yell again?

171
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,120
You're so reckless.

172
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,640
And you brought two people.

173
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:39,880
Every single day.

174
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,720
Get lost.

175
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,720
Mr. Lin

176
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,680
has set a benchmark for our Xinchun

177
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,440
wood processing industry.

178
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,440
This spirit is worth learning from.

179
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,000
Director Zhang, you flatter me.

180
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,260
You praise me too much.

181
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,080
Everyone here today is my senior.

182
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:57,960
Mr. Teng,

183
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,000
Mr. Li.

184
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,120
I was just lucky.

185
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,360
I followed the policies closely,

186
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,080
and then,

187
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,640
just did my job.

188
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,760
Last month,

189
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,580
the province just issued an official document.

190
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,640
Starting this year, Korean pine

191
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:12,360
has been officially listed as a key protected plant.

192
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,520
Commercial logging is completely banned.

193
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,980
To all the bosses present,

194
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:16,880
I know

195
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,060
you still have some materials on hand

196
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:21,000
and some timber in the warehouse.

197
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,840
Every factory is under a lot of pressure.

198
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:23,900
I understand that.

199
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:24,760
But

200
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,600
I'll make myself clear today.

201
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,120
The red line is the red line.

202
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:30,280
Whoever crosses it is doomed.

203
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,960
That's all for today.

204
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,250
Sorry for the trouble, Mr. Lin.

205
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,440
Director Zhang, look,

206
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,600
it's almost time to eat.

207
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,840
I booked a table next to our factory

208
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,080
at Linhai Restaurant.

209
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,320
Let's sit down and have a meal together,

210
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,520
and you can tell us more.

211
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:41,960
No, thanks.

212
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,120
I still have work at the bureau.

213
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,580
We'll be heading back now.

214
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,520
Get back to your work, Old Lin.

215
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,680
Then I'll see you off.

216
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,160
This way.

217
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:48,680
Go back to work.

218
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,320
It's fine.

219
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,360
Mr. Wang.

220
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,960
We talked on the phone for quite a while.

221
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,080
You came here this time

222
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,880
mainly for

223
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,210
the Korean pine timber.

224
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,460
I need 2,000 cubic meters.

225
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,120
1,000 cubic meters of it must be old timber.

226
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,760
The quality must be good.

227
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,820
Preferably stored for over 15 years.

228
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,920
The other 1,000 cubic meters

229
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:19,960
can be new timber

230
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,420
from recent years.

231
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,160
Mr. Wang.

232
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,160
2,000 cubic meters of Korean pine.

233
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,120
What big item

234
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,440
are you making?

235
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:27,200
Coffins.

236
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,440
Coffins?

237
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,640
People in the south are very particular.

238
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,080
There are plenty of people who want to depart with dignity.

239
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,760
They know the Korean pine from the Northeast is good,

240
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,280
so their standards are high.

241
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,160
They want no knots,

242
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,820
and definitely no wormholes.

243
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:40,840
Mr. Wang.

244
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,240
Your timing is both good

245
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,560
and bad.

246
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:47,400
You heard Director Zhang's instructions this afternoon.

247
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,280
Now, Korean pine

248
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,640
is completely banned from logging.

249
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,320
From now on,

250
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:53,320
not a single log can be transported down the mountain.

251
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,080
However,

252
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,160
policies are rigid,

253
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,240
but we

254
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,400
are flexible.

255
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,860
When I, Lin Shengli, do business,

256
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,800
I never cheat.

257
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:08,160
Mr. Lin.

258
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:09,800
I happened to be eating nearby.

259
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,600
They said you were here,

260
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,860
so I came over to say hi.

261
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,120
You didn't even tell me you were here.

262
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,560
I didn't know it would be such a coincidence.

263
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,760
Are you done with the factory work?

264
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,600
Yes, I am.

265
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:20,920
Come, have a seat.

266
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:21,960
Bring another set of tableware.

267
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:22,480
Okay.

268
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,960
Let me introduce you.

269
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:25,800
This is Mr. Wang,

270
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,080
from Jiangcheng.

271
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,760
Wang Hong.

272
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,880
And this is Li Xuefei.

273
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,120
She's a local,

274
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,400
the manager of Zhijun Furniture Factory.

275
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,680
Xuefei is smart, capable,

276
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,640
and full of ideas.

277
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:37,120
He's a great businessman.

278
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,160
We've met before.

279
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,320
I heard a big boss from the south was coming.

280
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,180
I didn't expect you to be so young.

281
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,760
Thank you for helping me out today, Miss Li.

282
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:48,240
If you need someone to run errands and gather information,

283
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,800
or show you some local food,

284
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,520
just let me know.

285
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,840
Please don't hesitate.

286
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,900
Thank you, Miss Li.

287
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:03,760
Mr. Lin.

288
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:05,720
My alcohol tolerance

289
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,640
is really limited.

290
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,200
I'll just

291
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,840
finish this pot.

292
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,160
I'll head back first.

293
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,440
You're downing the whole pot.

294
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,440
I'm heading out.

295
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:16,400
Let's

296
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,120
get together another time.

297
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,250
Okay, another time.

298
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,240
Mr. Wang,

299
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,770
let me take you back.

300
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,200
No need. I'll just have Dajun take him.

301
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:27,200
It's fine. We're going the same way.

302
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:28,880
Okay.

303
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,360
Slow down.

304
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,640
Are you going to throw up?

305
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,160
Hello.

306
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,740
Is anyone here?

307
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,440
Coming.

308
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,040
Hello.

309
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:46,680
Coming.

310
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:48,560
Could you check which room Wang Hong is in?

311
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:49,560
He drank too much.

312
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,000
Room 302.

313
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,120
Is there a room available next to his?

314
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,280
I'd like to book another one.

315
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,440
Is the one diagonally across okay?

316
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,080
Sure.

317
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,120
Okay, it's all done.

318
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,050
Okay, thank you.

319
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:05,880
Hello, Dad.

320
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:07,880
It went pretty well.

321
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,580
I won't be coming home for a while.

322
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,880
Mr. Wang drank too much.

323
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,540
I booked a room at their hotel.

324
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,320
I'm an adult now.

325
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,520
I know what I'm doing.

326
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,760
Slow down, slow down.

327
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,360
The word is out.

328
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:33,600
See you later.
